WEBVTT

00:00:07.039 --> 00:00:10.008
Disgaea

00:00:10.843 --> 00:00:16.304
Ai no tameiki ni
shibarareteru mitai.

00:00:16.415 --> 00:00:21.375
Donna jumon de mo
hodokenai no yo.

00:00:23.689 --> 00:00:29.093
Urei wo hisometa
shizuka na hitomi ga...

00:00:29.195 --> 00:00:34.326
...yokei ni kokoro
kakimidashiteku.

00:00:36.569 --> 00:00:42.872
Sunao ja nai watashi
yori motto...

00:00:42.975 --> 00:00:49.107
...sunao ja nai anata
ga itoshii.

00:00:49.248 --> 00:00:55.278
Anata ga ii no,
akuma de mo ii.

00:00:55.855 --> 00:01:01.987
Ah, ima meguriaeta kiseki.

00:01:02.128 --> 00:01:08.499
Kienai kizu mo,
fukai karuma mo.

00:01:08.601 --> 00:01:11.832
Ah aishitageru,

00:01:12.038 --> 00:01:14.336
doko ni ite mo
nando demo.

00:01:20.279 --> 00:01:22.975
Aishitageru.

00:01:32.959 --> 00:01:37.487
Damn it, how come I'M stuck with
doing the cleaning around here?!

00:01:37.597 --> 00:01:39.360
Stupid Prinnies!

00:01:42.001 --> 00:01:43.730
Ow...

00:01:44.337 --> 00:01:45.599
I'm sorry!

00:01:45.705 --> 00:01:47.332
What's all this,
Flonne?

00:01:47.707 --> 00:01:50.198
Well, the dirty laundry
has been piling up.

00:01:50.643 --> 00:01:53.237
Did the Prinnies
go on strike again?

00:01:53.679 --> 00:01:56.842
No matter how many times I call them,
they don't show up. Watch this.

00:01:57.583 --> 00:02:01.075
Prinnies!
Front and center!

00:02:02.922 --> 00:02:03.616
See?

00:02:03.956 --> 00:02:05.423
"See?" my butt!

00:02:05.825 --> 00:02:09.192
Just how long do you expect me
to go without a decent meal?

00:02:09.629 --> 00:02:11.563
Are you trying to starve me
to death?!

00:02:11.697 --> 00:02:13.688
What about the food that
Flonne made for you?

00:02:14.100 --> 00:02:16.227
You call that food?

00:02:16.869 --> 00:02:19.201
Guess it depends on
your definition...

00:02:20.506 --> 00:02:24.408
That's so mean! Admittedly, I'm not
very confident about the taste...

00:02:24.510 --> 00:02:28.241
Anyway, get out there and find the Prinnies,
and then have them cook me dinner!

00:02:36.656 --> 00:02:38.021
What IS all this stuff?

00:02:38.124 --> 00:02:39.614
Garbage that's been
piling up, I guess.

00:02:39.725 --> 00:02:42.250
Sheesh, it sure is a hassle without
the Prinnies around...

00:02:42.595 --> 00:02:43.562
Throw it out.

00:02:43.663 --> 00:02:44.857
- Sure.
- Sure.

00:02:44.997 --> 00:02:50.958
The Prinnies'
Longest Day, Dood!

00:02:53.105 --> 00:02:56.472
Heave ho, heave ho,
heave ho...

00:02:56.909 --> 00:03:01.107
Highness, quit lounging around up there
and give us a hand!

00:03:01.414 --> 00:03:06.283
I came along to look for the Prinnies.
When I find them, they're going to regret it.

00:03:06.552 --> 00:03:10.181
Still, what do you think happened?
Why would they all leave at once?

00:03:10.289 --> 00:03:11.688
It didn't happen
all at once.

00:03:11.791 --> 00:03:16.228
At first, they came to me one by one, saying
stuff like, "Can I have some time off, dood?"

00:03:16.562 --> 00:03:20.054
I blew 'em off, and before I knew it,
they'd all vanished. It's crazy.

00:03:20.166 --> 00:03:21.394
Etna, look at that!

00:03:24.036 --> 00:03:27.870
C'mon, people, how are you supposed to walk
down the street if you fill it with trash?

00:03:34.013 --> 00:03:35.981
That was some good
thinking, Laharl!

00:03:36.082 --> 00:03:37.242
All right, let's go.

00:03:37.583 --> 00:03:40.347
Who dares?! Don't they know that
I'm the great Overlord Laharl?!

00:03:50.529 --> 00:03:53.692
Looks like they're saying the
same things as us, Highness.

00:03:53.799 --> 00:03:56.791
Do you suppose that the Prinnies
vanished from here, too?

00:04:02.441 --> 00:04:06.810
At this rate, it won't be long before the
Netherworld is up to its eyeballs in trash.

00:04:12.251 --> 00:04:13.240
Where do you think
you're going?

00:04:13.919 --> 00:04:16.683
I'm sorry, dood!
Have mercy!

00:04:17.356 --> 00:04:19.688
What are you
people planning?

00:04:20.326 --> 00:04:22.988
Planning? Who, us?
Um... Why, that's a good question!

00:04:23.095 --> 00:04:25.256
Where am I, dood?
Who am I, dood?

00:04:26.098 --> 00:04:27.429
Can't breathe, dood...

00:04:27.533 --> 00:04:31.697
No, Laharl! You mustn't be
so rough with the Prinnies!

00:04:31.804 --> 00:04:33.567
Where are the other Prinnies?!

00:04:35.007 --> 00:04:38.841
You know, don't you? Look, I think it's in
your own best interests to start talking.

00:04:44.617 --> 00:04:46.482
So heavy...
Can't take much more, dood...

00:04:46.585 --> 00:04:48.485
Shut your beak and take us
to the others!

00:04:48.587 --> 00:04:50.350
I feel bad for him,
Laharl.

00:04:50.456 --> 00:04:52.424
Then maybe you should get
out and walk, Flonne.

00:04:52.525 --> 00:04:57.428
Well, um... I'm starving, too,
so I can't walk another step.

00:05:07.440 --> 00:05:09.305
So long, doods!

00:05:09.942 --> 00:05:11.409
Ow, dood!

00:05:14.280 --> 00:05:16.373
Should've known better,
dood...

00:05:20.119 --> 00:05:21.882
Prinny, are you
all right?!

00:05:23.055 --> 00:05:24.682
What's going on
down there?

00:05:39.705 --> 00:05:42.299
Wow, look at all the
Prinnies down there!

00:05:42.408 --> 00:05:44.876
Where do you think
they're all going?

00:05:47.413 --> 00:05:49.677
To that island,
looks like.

00:05:49.982 --> 00:05:51.882
This is rebellion against
the Netherworld!

00:05:51.984 --> 00:05:55.385
No, even worse! It's a rebellion
against Laharl, the next Overlord!

00:05:57.356 --> 00:06:01.019
Highness, I think the first order of business
should be to find out what they're up to!

00:06:01.127 --> 00:06:03.687
You'll still have plenty of time to
blow them to smithereens afterwards!

00:06:04.730 --> 00:06:06.459
I've found you,
Prince!

00:06:06.565 --> 00:06:09.693
The time has finally come for, Gordon, the
37th Defender of Earth and his sidekicks...

00:06:09.802 --> 00:06:12.066
...to settle this
once and for all!

00:06:12.404 --> 00:06:13.962
Let's see what
you've got!

00:06:14.073 --> 00:06:15.165
- Come on!
- Come on!

00:06:15.274 --> 00:06:18.175
You traitorous Prinnies, prepare to
be shown the error of your ways!

00:06:18.277 --> 00:06:18.936
Wha...?

00:06:19.044 --> 00:06:19.976
Oh, dear.

00:06:20.379 --> 00:06:25.043
I'm sorry! It looks like Laharl doesn't
have time to play with you right now.

00:06:25.217 --> 00:06:28.584
More to the point, why do you always
have such bad timing? Bye bye!

00:06:28.687 --> 00:06:31.952
Why? Was there something
wrong with our pose?

00:06:32.057 --> 00:06:33.957
How about this one?
Or maybe this one?

00:06:36.162 --> 00:06:37.959
We did it!
It's perfect!

00:06:38.097 --> 00:06:39.724
You look wonderful
in that, Laharl!

00:06:39.865 --> 00:06:42.299
You're the spitting image of a Prinny,
no ifs ands or buts!

00:06:42.401 --> 00:06:43.959
Way to go,
master of disguise!

00:06:44.270 --> 00:06:45.601
Are you two
mocking me?!

00:06:45.704 --> 00:06:48.935
Not at all! The only way to sneak onto that
island without arousing any suspicion...

00:06:49.041 --> 00:06:51.202
...is to mix in with
the Prinnies!

00:06:51.610 --> 00:06:53.009
See? We have
disguises, too!

00:06:53.345 --> 00:06:57.076
Actually, I had hoped to make mine a little
cuter by adding ribbons and frills.

00:06:57.783 --> 00:07:01.082
Let's go. If this goes on much longer,
I won't be able to stand upright.

00:07:03.455 --> 00:07:05.320
All aboard, doods!

00:07:05.424 --> 00:07:07.289
Wait!

00:07:08.294 --> 00:07:10.091
Pardon us.
Coming through.

00:07:10.196 --> 00:07:11.322
Sorry, everyone!

00:07:12.097 --> 00:07:13.928
Whew, we made it...

00:07:14.266 --> 00:07:16.063
I was worried for
a second there...

00:07:16.702 --> 00:07:18.932
Hey. HEY!

00:07:19.271 --> 00:07:21.102
Something the matter,
Highness?

00:07:21.607 --> 00:07:23.905
Why does my disguise
only have a head?!

00:07:24.243 --> 00:07:26.973
Um... I kinda miscalculated
on the budget.

00:07:27.112 --> 00:07:28.670
But it looks wonderful!

00:07:28.781 --> 00:07:29.873
Sure does!

00:07:29.982 --> 00:07:32.780
Are you three doods
really Prinnies?

00:07:33.886 --> 00:07:36.150
What? Why do
you ask?

00:07:36.388 --> 00:07:37.821
You doods talk funny.

00:07:38.257 --> 00:07:39.588
Yeah, dood!
It's weird!

00:07:39.692 --> 00:07:42.490
There's nothing weird about us at all!
Um, "doods".

00:07:42.628 --> 00:07:44.323
Of course we're
Prinnies, doods!

00:07:44.597 --> 00:07:47.122
We're all one big happy Prinny
family here, right, dood?

00:07:47.266 --> 00:07:48.597
Ha ha ha, dood!

00:07:48.701 --> 00:07:50.362
Set sail, dood!

00:07:55.474 --> 00:07:57.374
Why isn't our size raising
any eyebrows?

00:07:57.476 --> 00:07:59.603
Sshh! Well, they
ARE Prinnies, dood.

00:07:59.745 --> 00:08:01.576
Put a "dood"
at the end, dood!

00:08:02.615 --> 00:08:03.741
Dood.

00:08:30.809 --> 00:08:32.970
It's like a big festival
or something, dood.

00:08:33.078 --> 00:08:34.875
Why do you think is about
to happen, dood?

00:08:34.980 --> 00:08:37.278
Doods! Our day has
come at last!

00:08:37.716 --> 00:08:40.583
We're not gonna let 'em work
us like slaves anymore, doods!

00:08:40.919 --> 00:08:43.513
Join together and achieve
victory, doods!

00:08:43.722 --> 00:08:45.314
Right on, dood!

00:08:45.424 --> 00:08:48.052
For one thing,
the demons are stupid!

00:08:48.427 --> 00:08:51.362
If they think we're gonna be their
obedient little Prinnies forever,

00:08:51.497 --> 00:08:52.862
they're in for a nasty surprise,
doods!

00:08:53.098 --> 00:08:54.360
Right on, dood!

00:08:54.466 --> 00:08:55.592
What did he say?!

00:08:55.768 --> 00:08:59.204
Dood! I see we have a stouthearted
fellow Prinny with us today!

00:08:59.538 --> 00:09:01.005
We can expect great things
from this dood!

00:09:05.177 --> 00:09:06.667
Tomorrow is zero hour,
dood!

00:09:06.779 --> 00:09:08.212
Fight alongside us,
dood!

00:09:08.347 --> 00:09:10.440
Which moron have you
been serving, dood?

00:09:11.784 --> 00:09:12.978
Keep your hands
off me!

00:09:18.991 --> 00:09:21.482
What are you feathered clowns
planning to do?

00:09:21.627 --> 00:09:22.616
- "Dood"!
- "Dood"!

00:09:23.162 --> 00:09:24.060
What?

00:09:28.100 --> 00:09:29.294
What's the big idea?

00:09:29.535 --> 00:09:31.162
He's had too much
to drink, doods!

00:09:31.403 --> 00:09:33.837
You stinker! When you're drunk, the first
thing you do is try to pick a fight, dood!

00:09:34.039 --> 00:09:36.337
We're sorry we cause
a scene, doods!

00:09:36.442 --> 00:09:38.433
Hey! Where are you taking me?!
What do you think you're doing?!

00:09:38.544 --> 00:09:40.068
- "Dood"!
- "Dood"!

00:09:43.282 --> 00:09:46.376
How dare you treat me like
some common drunkard?!

00:09:46.485 --> 00:09:51.752
I don't care how powerful you are, Highness!
Ticking off that many Prinnies is a bad idea!

00:09:52.191 --> 00:09:55.752
Besides, the fireball you conjured up
wasn't as big as usual, dood.

00:09:55.861 --> 00:09:57.488
You don't need to keep
talking like that.

00:09:57.696 --> 00:09:58.754
Oh.

00:09:58.864 --> 00:10:00.798
I'm so hungry that
I'm at my limit.

00:10:02.067 --> 00:10:04.262
Desperate times call for desperate measures!
Make me something to eat!

00:10:05.003 --> 00:10:06.368
In that case, I’ll...

00:10:06.805 --> 00:10:07.965
Not you!

00:10:10.776 --> 00:10:12.767
You three doods are spies,
aren't you?!

00:10:12.878 --> 00:10:16.245
We have you completely surrounded!
You have nowhere to run, dood!

00:10:17.316 --> 00:10:19.079
Now, doods!
Attack!

00:10:19.218 --> 00:10:21.118
Yeah, dood!

00:10:24.456 --> 00:10:26.549
Laharl, what are we
going to do?

00:10:34.566 --> 00:10:36.557
Disgaea

00:10:37.603 --> 00:10:43.564
Disgaea

00:10:53.018 --> 00:10:55.316
I don't believe it! They've set
the place on fire!

00:10:55.587 --> 00:10:56.815
Laharl!

00:10:57.322 --> 00:10:58.846
I don't have
the energy...

00:10:59.558 --> 00:11:00.718
In that case,
allow me!

00:11:01.427 --> 00:11:04.260
Be restored,
strength of love!

00:11:05.230 --> 00:11:06.788
Um, there doesn't seem to be
any light coming out...

00:11:07.132 --> 00:11:09.157
Sorry, I'm really
hungry, too.

00:11:11.870 --> 00:11:13.201
We're in a real
pinch here!

00:11:14.473 --> 00:11:15.997
You can escape
through here!

00:11:16.742 --> 00:11:17.834
This way!

00:11:19.845 --> 00:11:21.039
Who are you?

00:11:24.516 --> 00:11:25.642
Hurry!

00:11:33.192 --> 00:11:34.750
I'm glad to see
that you are safe.

00:11:39.131 --> 00:11:43.363
Oh, so you were the one who rescued us.
I don't know how to thank you.

00:11:43.702 --> 00:11:46.796
Haven't I seen you somewhere before?
You're one of my vassals, aren't you?

00:11:47.706 --> 00:11:48.695
Follow me.

00:11:48.807 --> 00:11:50.297
Hey, wait!

00:11:53.946 --> 00:11:55.846
Where are you
taking us?

00:11:55.948 --> 00:11:57.813
Please watch
your step.

00:12:05.557 --> 00:12:07.457
What is this,
a secret base?

00:12:07.559 --> 00:12:10.528
Oh! This must be one of those
"secret hideout" things!

00:12:10.629 --> 00:12:13.154
You know, like in the spy movies!
This is so exciting!

00:12:13.265 --> 00:12:15.062
I don't care what it is,
just bring me food!

00:12:20.506 --> 00:12:21.302
Delicious!

00:12:21.840 --> 00:12:25.970
I'm moved beyond words to be able to eat
a decent meal again... It's been so long!

00:12:26.311 --> 00:12:29.940
And I'M moved to tears over meeting
a decent vassal for the first time in ages.

00:12:30.315 --> 00:12:32.909
But I have to ask,
why did you save us?

00:12:38.457 --> 00:12:42.450
What is taking shape here is nothing
less than a Prinny coup d'etat.

00:12:44.897 --> 00:12:47.491
They hope to overthrow the Netherworld
that is now ruled by the Overlord...

00:12:47.599 --> 00:12:51.228
...and establish an independent country
that is of, for, and by the Prinnies.

00:12:51.336 --> 00:12:52.496
They're WHAT?

00:12:53.272 --> 00:12:57.368
At first, the movement was only to demand
improvements in working conditions.

00:12:57.709 --> 00:13:02.806
But eventually, the talk escalated into
a plan for founding a Prinny utopia.

00:13:03.515 --> 00:13:07.076
But is that really what made
all the Prinnies gather here?

00:13:07.519 --> 00:13:10.249
There is someone controlling the
Prinnies from behind the scenes.

00:13:10.589 --> 00:13:12.853
So, who is this
secret mastermind?

00:13:13.191 --> 00:13:14.681
I don't know that.

00:13:14.793 --> 00:13:18.194
Who do they think they are?
Bunch of stupid Prinnies!

00:13:19.831 --> 00:13:21.924
T-They'll pay for this!

00:13:27.406 --> 00:13:29.374
Thank you
for waiting, doods!

00:13:30.842 --> 00:13:34.903
Without further ado, let the
Prinnyworld Founding Ceremony begin!

00:13:38.717 --> 00:13:40.048
"Prinnyworld," huh?!

00:13:40.152 --> 00:13:42.347
Highness, they'll see you!
They'll see you!

00:13:42.554 --> 00:13:44.647
I wonder when the mastermind
will show himself?

00:13:45.057 --> 00:13:51.326
First up is our opening attraction!
The Prinny All-stars Baseball Tournament!

00:13:55.434 --> 00:13:58.995
Next up, the All-Netherworld
Quiz Contest!

00:13:59.104 --> 00:14:02.039
Do any of you doods
wanna go to Celestia?!

00:14:05.043 --> 00:14:05.907
This is ridiculous.

00:14:06.311 --> 00:14:09.212
And now, doods,
the Prinny Magic Show!

00:14:10.616 --> 00:14:16.077
Will the second Princess Prinny
manage to escape this time?!

00:14:17.756 --> 00:14:19.417
I can't take it anymore!

00:14:20.058 --> 00:14:21.320
Highness, don't!

00:14:24.062 --> 00:14:27.327
All right, you bastards!
Stop this nonsense!

00:14:36.174 --> 00:14:38.438
Doods, all rise for
the national anthem.

00:14:42.080 --> 00:14:49.384
Oh, Prinnies, where is your home?
Oh, Prinnies, our home is Prinnyworld!

00:14:49.688 --> 00:14:53.681
All for one and one for all, united we stand!
All for one and one for all, united we fall!

00:14:53.792 --> 00:14:56.192
Prinny, prinny, prinny...

00:14:56.294 --> 00:14:58.159
Amazing, they even
made a flag!

00:14:58.497 --> 00:15:00.397
What's going on
around here?

00:15:02.000 --> 00:15:04.127
How long are you clowns
going to keep this up?!

00:15:13.545 --> 00:15:15.069
He's a spy, dood!

00:15:19.418 --> 00:15:21.443
Look, Etna!
Prinny hooliganism!

00:15:21.920 --> 00:15:23.854
Why do you know all about
THAT kind of stuff?

00:15:25.657 --> 00:15:28.592
Hear me, Prinnies!
Calm yourselves, doods!

00:15:35.000 --> 00:15:38.060
Well, well, if it isn't
Prince Laharl.

00:15:39.071 --> 00:15:40.003
Who are you?!

00:15:40.405 --> 00:15:43.169
I am just an
old Prinny.

00:15:43.275 --> 00:15:45.709
How do you do,
Highness?

00:15:46.511 --> 00:15:48.445
An old Prinny?

00:15:48.547 --> 00:15:50.037
He's laying it on a little thick,
isn't he?

00:15:50.449 --> 00:15:54.010
You honor us by attending this
ceremony to commemorate...

00:15:54.119 --> 00:15:56.417
...the founding of our
independent nation.

00:15:57.656 --> 00:16:02.218
Do you seriously believe that I would
ever give my blessing to such a thing?

00:16:02.894 --> 00:16:04.691
How droll, Highness.

00:16:06.198 --> 00:16:08.689
We will win our independence
regardless of whether or not...

00:16:08.800 --> 00:16:11.166
...you grant recognition
to our country, Highness.

00:16:11.269 --> 00:16:12.361
What?

00:16:12.471 --> 00:16:15.304
For far too long have we Prinnies
been mistreated...

00:16:15.407 --> 00:16:18.069
...at the hands of you demons
here in the Netherworld.

00:16:18.310 --> 00:16:21.177
Our dearest dream is to achieve
independence from Netherworld rule!

00:16:21.279 --> 00:16:26.342
Rather, it is the dream of the
guardian god who watches over us!

00:16:38.396 --> 00:16:40.227
What the heck kind
of ritual is this?

00:16:40.565 --> 00:16:42.328
This is seriously spooky...

00:16:42.667 --> 00:16:45.227
For the last time,
quit messing...

00:16:48.874 --> 00:16:50.239
Look!

00:17:04.956 --> 00:17:08.221
You have awakened the anger
of the guardian!

00:17:16.735 --> 00:17:18.225
Guardian, huh?
We'll see about that!

00:17:18.870 --> 00:17:22.897
This is clearly the time to send in
Gordon, 37th Defender of Earth!

00:17:23.008 --> 00:17:25.272
My throwing arm
is plenty warmed up!

00:17:26.278 --> 00:17:27.939
You clowns again?

00:17:28.513 --> 00:17:31.311
Listen, no one is going to
defeat the Prince but ME!

00:17:31.416 --> 00:17:33.316
I won't let anyone interfere!

00:17:33.451 --> 00:17:36.784
Thursday, Robo-bazooka!
Blow it into orbit!

00:17:37.088 --> 00:17:39.113
ROGER. NOW CHANGING.

00:17:44.296 --> 00:17:48.027
Energy charging... Charging...
Charging...

00:17:48.233 --> 00:17:49.666
Fire!

00:17:53.205 --> 00:17:55.435
We got it!
It's a home run!

00:18:08.653 --> 00:18:09.779
Really?!

00:18:15.227 --> 00:18:17.058
It's Pringer X, dood!

00:18:17.162 --> 00:18:20.427
The guardian has transformed
into Pringer X, dood!

00:18:21.333 --> 00:18:22.857
"Pringer X"?

00:18:22.968 --> 00:18:25.129
Wow, that's so cool!

00:18:31.977 --> 00:18:33.001
How can this be?!

00:18:33.111 --> 00:18:34.043
Why?!

00:18:34.145 --> 00:18:35.976
GAME, SET, AND MATCH!

00:18:36.548 --> 00:18:39.039
That's what they get
for butting in.

00:18:39.150 --> 00:18:41.015
Behold, doods!

00:18:41.119 --> 00:18:43.553
Look on, Prinnies from
across the Netherworld!

00:18:43.922 --> 00:18:45.514
Look where he is!

00:18:45.657 --> 00:18:48.455
You're pretty spry for
an old-timer, mister.

00:18:48.560 --> 00:18:53.122
I hereby proclaim the independence
of Prinnyworld!

00:18:54.432 --> 00:19:01.736
And I proclaim myself Dartsbrink III,
first Prinny Overlord!

00:19:02.407 --> 00:19:07.208
If he's Dartsbrink III, doesn't that
mean that there's also a I and II?

00:19:07.412 --> 00:19:09.243
Hey! Don't let the moment
go to your head!

00:19:09.447 --> 00:19:10.971
"Prinny Overlord," eh?

00:19:11.216 --> 00:19:15.448
Indeed, dood! The Netherworld
is already under our control!

00:19:15.553 --> 00:19:19.114
I am the only one fit to be called Overlord!
We no longer have any use for you!

00:19:19.557 --> 00:19:21.991
Fire, Pringer X!

00:19:22.961 --> 00:19:25.555
Cool, it answered him!

00:19:35.974 --> 00:19:38.374
So, you're the mastermind
behind this sham?

00:19:39.978 --> 00:19:44.813
When it comes to Prinnies trying to found
a country or whatever, I couldn't care less!

00:19:45.150 --> 00:19:49.177
But when a lowly Prinny like you has the gall
to call himself Overlord, THAT will not stand!

00:19:49.287 --> 00:19:50.379
Silence, dood!

00:19:50.722 --> 00:19:54.180
The Netherworld and Prinnyworld now both
belong to me, the Prinny Overlord!

00:19:54.292 --> 00:19:56.260
Finish him, dood!

00:20:15.480 --> 00:20:18.677
No, Laharl, don't!
Don't do it!

00:20:37.669 --> 00:20:41.730
Aw, I was hoping to take back
Pringer X as a souvenir...

00:20:41.840 --> 00:20:43.467
That's why you told him
to stop?

00:20:43.975 --> 00:20:44.873
Now what?!

00:20:47.512 --> 00:20:50.140
King Darts! King Darts!
King Darts!

00:20:50.348 --> 00:20:51.246
King Darts!

00:20:51.349 --> 00:20:52.680
I don't hear you.

00:20:53.385 --> 00:20:54.579
Prinny Overlord!

00:20:54.686 --> 00:20:56.119
What is it, dood?

00:20:56.221 --> 00:20:58.314
Dood, I have
terrible news!

00:20:58.423 --> 00:21:01.085
Prinnyworld has begun to sink under
the collected weight of the Prinnies...

00:21:01.226 --> 00:21:03.717
...that came here from the four
corners of the Netherworld!

00:21:03.828 --> 00:21:05.489
It's what?!

00:21:05.797 --> 00:21:08.994
Well, that's Prinnies for you.
They aren't too bright.

00:21:09.434 --> 00:21:10.594
Let's get out
of here!

00:21:10.735 --> 00:21:13.898
The revolution has ended
in failure, King Darts...

00:21:14.606 --> 00:21:16.836
You will address me
as Prinny Overlord, dood!

00:21:22.847 --> 00:21:24.474
Prinnies! Laundry!

00:21:24.916 --> 00:21:26.110
Yes, dood!

00:21:26.418 --> 00:21:27.715
Is my food
ready yet?!

00:21:27.952 --> 00:21:29.613
Coming right up,
dood!

00:21:30.255 --> 00:21:32.120
Prinnies, could you take out
the garbage, please?

00:21:32.223 --> 00:21:33.485
Yessir, yessir, dood!

00:21:33.825 --> 00:21:35.383
Just one "Yessir"
is plenty!

00:21:35.493 --> 00:21:36.460
Yessir, dood!

00:21:36.995 --> 00:21:41.091
The Prinnies are working a lot harder
than they did before, aren't they?

00:21:41.466 --> 00:21:46.096
That's not surprising. After all, they came
back after trying to launch a rebellion.

00:21:46.638 --> 00:21:48.196
Hey, no running
in the hallway!

00:21:48.306 --> 00:21:50.137
Yes, dood!
Sorry, dood!

00:21:50.375 --> 00:21:53.606
Well, this obedience
might not last for long.

00:21:54.045 --> 00:21:56.240
Hey, you're that
Prinny who...

00:21:58.416 --> 00:22:01.544
I'll never understand what goes on
inside a Prinny's head...

00:22:01.986 --> 00:22:03.112
Prinnies!

00:22:04.389 --> 00:22:06.755
Yessir!
You rang, dood?

00:22:06.858 --> 00:22:08.291
I was just checking.

00:22:10.161 --> 00:22:11.822
Highness, you're terrible.

00:22:12.230 --> 00:22:14.892
We're setting out after we're though eating.
Is that clear?

00:22:14.999 --> 00:22:16.193
- Right!
- Right!

00:22:16.935 --> 00:22:19.495
Until the day comes when we
shall rise up once again...

00:22:19.604 --> 00:22:21.469
...we shall silently endure
this ordeal, dood!

00:22:21.573 --> 00:22:25.009
...Oh, Prinnies, our home
is Prinnyworld!

00:22:41.693 --> 00:22:49.122
Aoi hiru ga meguru hoshi de
toki no ruupu mezametara,

00:22:49.467 --> 00:22:57.203
chigau kokoro motta mono atsumareba
nanika ga okiru yo.

00:22:57.509 --> 00:23:05.348
Yokubou de umeru no ka?
Ai wa hito no tame ni ugoko no ka?

00:23:05.450 --> 00:23:12.413
Dotchi datte kamawanai yo,
suki ni yaru dake.

00:23:13.091 --> 00:23:20.862
Hikari to kage kono sekai de
subete ga imi aru egoisuto.

00:23:20.965 --> 00:23:28.667
Hitotsu hitotsu no kakera wa
sou baransu wo ninai ikiteru.

00:23:28.773 --> 00:23:40.514
Omou no mama, kokoro no mama ni
ima wa onaji sora no shita...

00:23:40.618 --> 00:23:44.611
...hikari to kage
wa kurikaesu.

00:23:45.523 --> 00:23:49.823
Chain react.

00:23:56.768 --> 00:23:59.931
I'm bored with doing a "babe this",
"babe that" schtick for each preview.

00:24:00.271 --> 00:24:02.398
Isn't there anything new
we could try?

00:24:02.774 --> 00:24:05.038
Why don't you try dropping
the "babe" part?

00:24:05.143 --> 00:24:06.940
What should I say, then?

00:24:07.045 --> 00:24:10.105
Hmm... How about using
"ugly" instead?

00:24:10.548 --> 00:24:13.483
Uh, Flonne, would you be able
to call yourself that?

00:24:13.885 --> 00:24:18.879
Next time on Disgaea,
"Space Battleship Gargantua"!

00:24:18.990 --> 00:24:20.625
Seriously, can you call yourself that?
Can you call yourself ugly? Fess up.

00:24:20.625 --> 00:24:22.794
Next Time:
Space Battleship Gargantua
Seriously, can you call yourself that?
Can you call yourself ugly? Fess up.

00:24:22.794 --> 00:24:24.862
Next Time:
Space Battleship Gargantua
Um, probably not.

00:24:24.862 --> 00:24:25.521
Next Time:
Space Battleship Gargantua
